{"key":"u13-apchem-mcq-028-v2","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"D","final_answer":"T-shaped","working":"The central bromine atom has 7 valence electrons. It forms three single bonds with fluorine atoms, using 3 electrons, leaving 4 non-bonding electrons (2 lone pairs). The steric number is 3 + 2 = 5, corresponding to a trigonal bipyramidal electron-pair geometry. To minimize electron repulsions, the two lone pairs occupy equatorial positions, resulting in a T-shaped molecular geometry.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":358,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":358,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":297,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":123,"reasoningTokens":174},"totalTokens":655,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":174,"promptTokenCount":358,"candidatesTokenCount":123,"totalTokenCount":655,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":358}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":123}]},"reasoningTokens":174,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":4088,"keyed_label":"D"}
{"key":"u13-apchem-mcq-028-v1","kind":"mcq","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","pass":"solve","ok":true,"object":{"chosen_label":"C","final_answer":"Square planar","working":"Xenon (Xe) has 8 valence electrons, and each of the four fluorine (F) atoms contributes 1 electron to form four Xe-F single bonds. This accounts for 4 bonding pairs, leaving 8 - 4 = 4 non-bonding valence electrons on Xe, which form 2 lone pairs. The steric number of Xe is 4 + 2 = 6, corresponding to an octahedral electron-pair geometry. To minimize electron-electron repulsion, the two lone pairs occupy positions opposite one another (trans), resulting in a square planar molecular geometry.","defect":""},"usage":{"inputTokens":355,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":355,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":338,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":154,"reasoningTokens":184},"totalTokens":693,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":184,"promptTokenCount":355,"candidatesTokenCount":154,"totalTokenCount":693,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":355}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":154}]},"reasoningTokens":184,"cachedInputTokens":0},"attempts":1,"mode":"object","ms":4508,"keyed_label":"C"}
